BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Computers for Beginners 1: Use the Mouse
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261114T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261114T113000
UID:6ad3a3bfa66d123e2bd4ffab@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A class on how to use a mouse for absolute beginners with litt
 le or no computer experience.\nIn this first session you will:\n- Observe 
 and practice how to operate a mouse effectively\n- Understand various mous
 e pointers and cursors\n- Review basic keyboard functions\n- Use the mouse
  for basic Windows functions\nUpon completion of this class students will 
 be able to use a computer mouse at a basic level and will be able to go on
 line for additional practice.
LOCATION:Parliament Street\, Second Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ad3a3bfa66d123e2bd4ffab
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
