UID:6a877294aafa6100295e0108@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Dr. Hamid Yazdi and explore how media narratives\, famili
 ar assumptions\, and everyday language shape public understanding of the 
 region. This talk invites audiences to question simplified explanations an
 d think more critically about what they hear. With real-world implications
  - from public debate to economic ripple effects - getting the Middle East
  right is more important than it seems.\nDrop in\, no registration require
 d.
