DESCRIPTION:Enjoy watching DVDs in the Library Auditorium.\nCoffee\, tea a
 nd cookies or snacks will be served after the film.  Ingredient lists will
  be available upon request.\nMarie Antoinette: The Doomed Queen\nBlamed fo
 r a revolution she didn’t start\, Marie Antoinette became history’s mo
 st misunderstood queen—famously (and falsely) accused of saying “let t
 hem eat cake.” Discover the truth behind the story that led to her tragi
 c end at the guillotine. Closed Captions. 56 minutes. 2020
