 l be able to use more advanced search engine features and use Google Maps 
 at a basic level.\nPrerequisites: Computers for Beginners 1\, 2 & 3 or bas
 ic mouse\, keyboarding and internet skills\nRegistration is required. Plea
 se register online or by calling 416-393-7700. Space is limited.\nInformat
 ion Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected
