DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261201T160000
UID:6ab2cc01001a4a0e055b355c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:As their marriage quietly unravels\, Alex (Will Arnett) faces
  middle age and an impeding divorce\, seeking new purpose in the New York
  comedy scene while\, his wife Tess (Laura Dern) confronts sacrifices mad
 e for their family\, forcing them to navigate co-parenting\, identity\, an
 d whether love can take a new form.\nR\, 121 minutes\n**Subtitles for the 
 deaf and hard of hearing when available (SDH).
LOCATION:Riverdale\, Program Room 1
