UID:6a7258b7b3bdcec4a666b968@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join other book lovers in your community and participate in li
 vely discussions of popular books. This book club will meet every first Tu
 esday of the month for a lively discussion in a welcoming\, relaxed settin
 g. New members are always welcome and encouraged to join.\nNovember 3\, 20
 26\n–\nBlindness by Jose Saramago\nDecember 1\, 2026\n–\nThe Glassmake
 r by Tracy Chevalier\nJanuary 5\, 2027 –\nThe House of Doors by Twan En
 g Tan\nFebruary 2\, 2027 –\nGood Eggs by Rebecca Hardiman\nCopies of th
 e book are available for borrowing at the Fairview Library.\nDrop-in\, no 
 registration necessary.
LOCATION:Fairview\, Room 201
