UID:6aeb4ef496ec3a003adf4423@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Our book for December is Stuart Little by E.B. White.\nStuart 
 Little is a mouse who lives with the Little family in an apartment in New 
 York City. His small size doesn’t prevent him from sailing ships\, drivi
 ng in car races\, and getting into a variety of adventures and narrow esca
 pes aided\, sometimes\, by Snowbell the cat. A beloved American classic.\n
 Copies available at the library.\nStuart Little
