 ks by Bach\, Barrios Mangoré\, Víctor Jara\, Luiz Bonfá\, and Chilean c
 omposers Antonio Restucci and Juan Antonio Sánchez\, alongside original c
 ompositions from her upcoming debut album\, this concert celebrates the ti
