DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261206T143000
UID:6aea7558de685359098dc483@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:At least 1 in 3 women and 1 in 5 men will suffer from a fragil
 ity fracture in their lifetime. Join us for a discussion bone health and w
 ellness given by Osteoporosis Canada. Attendees of this program will learn
 :\nhow to reduce their risk of osteoporosis\nhow to maintain healthy bones
