UID:6abfc99029c3d600332d2c3d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Experience the transformative power of writing in an inclusive
  space!\nA\nWriters Collective of Canada (WCC)\nworkshop is unlike any oth
 er. We write together\, share first drafts in an encouraging environment\,
  listen deeply to one another\, and receive supportive feedback. Tap into 
 your story and explore your voice in an environment of dignity\, courage\,
  and respect.\nNo experience required. Beginners are welcome. Materials ar
 e provided. Workshops are not sequential\; every workshop is unique - join
  in at any session and let's write together!\nDrop in\, no registration re
 quired\n. Please arrive a few minutes early. For more information\, please
  contact the branch.\n​Presented by Writers Collective of Canada (WCC)\,
  a charitable arts-health organization that ignites connection through cre
 ativity by inspiring powerful\, authentic stories shared in community.\nht
 tps://wcc-cec.org/
