UID:6aa9b7e2f9ed2e003850ec28@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join\nCary Lavine\, CPA\nto understand what fraud is and how i
 t works. Learn how to identify the signs of fraud and how to act on suspic
 ions. Recognize the top three scams.\nUnderstand why seniors are targeted 
 and know what to do if you are a victim of fraud.\nCary Lavine\, CPA\nis a
  retired entrepreneur and former Chief Financial Officer of RL Solutions w
 ith more than 30 years of experience in accounting\, finance\, and busines
 s leadership.\nDrop in. No registration required.\nOriginally scheduled fo
 r Dec 3rd\, will be moved Dec 9th
LOCATION:Richview\, Room A\, 2nd Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa9b7e2f9ed2e003850ec28
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
