 nd cookies or snacks will be served after the film.  Ingredient lists wil
 l be available upon request.\nWill A Robot Steal My Job?\nArtificial intel
 ligence is changing the way people work and may replace many jobs\, includ
 ing those of professionals like lawyers\, accountants\, and artists. This 
