 o provide tech help\, under the guidance of library staff. Learn the basic
 s of using smartphone and laptop. Learn about topics such as\nsmartphone 
 accessibility features\, smartphone basics\, using search engine and googl
 e AI\, downloading PDF's and email attachment and many more\n. Seniors may
  bring their own device and ask our teens volunteers for tech help. Get 
 one on one support in a welcoming and friendly environment.\nIf you're a t
 een between the ages of 13-17 and would like to learn more about becoming 
 a Seniors E-Connect volunteer\, visit the\nSeniors E-Connect Volunteering 
 page\nor email\nBeaches Branch\nbestaff@tpl.ca\n.\nInformation Collection 
