DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270102T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270102T113000
UID:6ad29f61a85a2c00338008fb@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Seniors E-Connect matches older adults with a teen volunteer t
 o provide tech help\, under the guidance of library staff. Learn the basic
 s of using smartphones\, tablets\, and laptops\nand learn about topics suc
 h as library databases\, various mobile apps\, Microsoft Office and Google
  Suite software. Get one on one support in a welcoming and friendly enviro
 nment.\nRegister online\, by phone or in-branch. Please bring your device(
